# 五、基础系统巡检

批量查看节点信息

创建：

vim test.yml

内容：

- name: Check system info
  hosts: kubernetes

  tasks:

  - name: Show hostname
    command: hostname

  - name: Show kernel
    command: uname -r

执行：

ansible-playbook -i hosts test.yml

Playbook：系统巡检

创建：

vim playbooks/system-check.yml

内容：

---
- name: Linux system check
  hosts: kubernetes
  become: yes

  tasks:

    - name: Check hostname
      command: hostname
      register: hostname_result

    - name: Check kernel version
      command: uname -r
      register: kernel_result

    - name: Check disk usage
      command: df -h
      register: disk_result


    - name: Show hostname
      debug:
        msg: "{{ hostname_result.stdout }}"


    - name: Show kernel
      debug:
        msg: "{{ kernel_result.stdout }}"

执行：

ansible-playbook -i hosts playbooks/system-check.yml


Ansible 自动化初始化 Kubernetes 节点
1. 先创建目录

进入：

cd ~/ansible-lab

创建：

mkdir -p playbooks
2. 创建 k8s-init.yml
vim playbooks/k8s-init.yml

写入：

---
- name: Kubernetes node initialization
  hosts: k8s_nodes
  become: yes

  tasks:

    # 关闭swap
    - name: Disable swap
      command: swapoff -a


    - name: Remove swap from fstab
      replace:
        path: /etc/fstab
        regexp: '^([^#].*\sswap\s.*)$'
        replace: '#\1'


    # 加载内核模块
    - name: Load kernel modules
      copy:
        dest: /etc/modules-load.d/k8s.conf
        content: |
          overlay
          br_netfilter


    - name: Load modules immediately
      shell: |
        modprobe overlay
        modprobe br_netfilter


    # Kubernetes网络参数
    - name: Configure sysctl for Kubernetes
      copy:
        dest: /etc/sysctl.d/k8s.conf
        content: |
          net.bridge.bridge-nf-call-iptables = 1
          net.bridge.bridge-nf-call-ip6tables = 1
          net.ipv4.ip_forward = 1


    - name: Apply sysctl
      command:
        sysctl --system


    # 安装基础工具
    - name: Install required packages
      apt:
        name:
          - curl
          - wget
          - apt-transport-https
          - ca-certificates
        state: present
        update_cache: yes


    # 重启containerd
    - name: Restart containerd
      systemd:
        name: containerd
        state: restarted
        enabled: yes


    # 检查服务
    - name: Check kubelet
      systemd:
        name: kubelet
      register: kubelet_status


    - name: Show kubelet status
      debug:
        msg: "{{ kubelet_status.status.ActiveState }}"

保存。

3. 执行

先检查语法：

ansible-playbook \
-i hosts \
playbooks/k8s-init.yml \
--syntax-check

正常：

playbook: playbooks/k8s-init.yml

执行：

ansible-playbook \
-i hosts \
playbooks/k8s-init.yml
4. 验证节点

执行：

ansible k8s_nodes -i hosts -m shell -a "free -h"

确认 swap：

应该：

Swap: 0B

查看模块：

ansible k8s_nodes -i hosts -m shell -a "lsmod | grep br_netfilter"

查看参数：

ansible k8s_nodes -i hosts -m shell -a "sysctl net.ipv4.ip_forward"

应该：

net.ipv4.ip_forward = 1



